{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q420028","formula":"C₉H₁₅NO₃","hill":"C9H15NO3","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":9.0,"H":15.0,"N":1.0,"O":3.0},"names":{"en":"Ecgonine","ru":"Экгонин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Ecgonine is a tropane alkaloid (alkaloid derivative of tropane) found naturally in coca leaves. It has a close structural relation to cocaine: it is both a metabolite and a precursor, and as such, it is a controlled substance in many jurisdictions, as are some substances which can be used as precursors to ecgonine itself. Structurally, ecgonine is a cycloheptane derivative with a nitrogen bridge.","ru":"Экгони́н — органическое вещество с формулой C9H15NO3, тропановый алкалоид, содержащийся в листьях коки. Структура экгонина родственна структуре кокаина. Экгонин может быть получен кислотным или щелочным гидролизом кокаина."},"fame":22,"pubchemCid":91460,"mass":185.22,"charge":0,"smiles":"CN1[C@H]2CC[C@@H]1[C@H]([C@H](C2)O)C(=O)O","inchikey":"PHMBVCPLDPDESM-FKSUSPILSA-N","iupac":"(1R,2R,3S,5S)-3-hydroxy-8-methyl-8-azabicyclo[3.2.1]octane-2-carboxylic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"91460","atoms":28,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-1.81,"y":-2.071,"z":0.017,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.499,"y":1.62,"z":0.71,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.073,"y":0.494,"z":-1.226,"el":"O"},{"x":1.037,"y":0.77,"z":-0.683,"el":"N"},{"x":0.536,"y":0.835,"z":0.706,"el":"C"},{"x":1.593,"y":-0.591,"z":-0.767,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.777,"y":0.015,"z":0.765,"el":"C"},{"x":1.647,"y":0.175,"z":1.533,"el":"C"},{"x":2.343,"y":-0.778,"z":0.556,"el":"C"},{"x":0.388,"y":-1.546,"z":-0.891,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.568,"y":-1.442,"z":0.308,"el":"C"},{"x":2.022,"y":1.807,"z":-0.981,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.837,"y":0.711,"z":-0.047,"el":"C"},{"x":0.342,"y":1.864,"z":1.032,"el":"H"},{"x":2.248,"y":-0.731,"z":-1.6